{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the truth behind what happened aboard the Erebus-9 in this retro-industrial, sci-fi reimagining of the famous poem <i>Dante\u2019s Inferno</i>. Aboard a decaying space station, the deeper you descend, the more unsettling the horrors you uncover. Solve puzzles, survive enemies, and piece together the story of the Erebus-9. Remember to always keep your wits about you, as you never know what lurks in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/f5921523a740217e74ee852a3ee904bf.avif?t=1762331918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/f5921523a740217e74ee852a3ee904bf.webp?t=1762331918 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/ba7a628dc8a2f0244d3fd10abe34d8e3.avif?t=1762331918\" width=1560 height=768 /></span>Explore the eerie, abandoned corridors of the research station Erebus-9 while collecting logs from the ill-fated crew to uncover the twisted tale of what transpired. Each new discovery unravels another layer of the mystery, but beware... some secrets are better left uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/ae61a8cfaa053a2d3fe57bdc03fd9fd2.avif?t=1762331918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/ae61a8cfaa053a2d3fe57bdc03fd9fd2.webp?t=1762331918 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/bf5be7fec2c678e6c9fc549a077ebb23.avif?t=1762331918\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lux Ignis is your lifeline in the dark. This unique tool not only illuminates your path, but can also help you defend against  hostile enemies. Make strategic use of it, as resources are scarce and the dangers are many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/a9d064c2eeb453818028d14a948c59b7.avif?t=1762331918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/a9d064c2eeb453818028d14a948c59b7.webp?t=1762331918 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/93d59f3db5f29964d827727d60549a31.avif?t=1762331918\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the station's secrets by solving puzzles that block your path forward. What seems like a simple obstacle might be hiding something more sinister behind it. Solve your way to safety, but don\u2019t forget: danger could be right behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Please note</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erebus-9 is  currently in development. The demo introduces you to the world of Erebus-9, featuring selected segments from the game\u2019s second level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the demo does not represent the final scope or content of the full game. All content shown is a work in progress and subject to change in the final release. The team at Centaurus Software is committed to refining Erebus-9 based on player feedback and testing. If you would like to be involved in the development of Erebus-9, please join our discord server:\u00a0<u></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full Chapter 1 release is currently targeted for Q1 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deeply appreciate your support, patience, and feedback as we continue shaping Erebus-9 into the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for playing and we hope you enjoy your time aboard the Erebus-9.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031350?t=1762331918","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/37338f0d23e17ebdad3f104e29e2d16cdb40a2a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762331918","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/2b3ebaa8fcb289eef861036a5e6ac3e31f435648/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762331918","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/2b3ebaa8fcb289eef861036a5e6ac3e31f435648/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762331918","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4109670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the truth behind what happened aboard the Erebus-9 in this retro-industrial, sci-fi reimagining of the famous poem <i>Dante\u2019s Inferno</i>. Aboard a decaying space station, the deeper you descend, the more unsettling the horrors you uncover. Solve puzzles, survive enemies, and piece together the story of the Erebus-9. Remember to always keep your wits about you, as you never know what lurks in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/f5921523a740217e74ee852a3ee904bf.avif?t=1762331918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/f5921523a740217e74ee852a3ee904bf.webp?t=1762331918 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/ba7a628dc8a2f0244d3fd10abe34d8e3.avif?t=1762331918\" width=1560 height=768 /></span>Explore the eerie, abandoned corridors of the research station Erebus-9 while collecting logs from the ill-fated crew to uncover the twisted tale of what transpired. Each new discovery unravels another layer of the mystery, but beware... some secrets are better left uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/ae61a8cfaa053a2d3fe57bdc03fd9fd2.avif?t=1762331918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/ae61a8cfaa053a2d3fe57bdc03fd9fd2.webp?t=1762331918 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/bf5be7fec2c678e6c9fc549a077ebb23.avif?t=1762331918\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lux Ignis is your lifeline in the dark. This unique tool not only illuminates your path, but can also help you defend against  hostile enemies. Make strategic use of it, as resources are scarce and the dangers are many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/a9d064c2eeb453818028d14a948c59b7.avif?t=1762331918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/a9d064c2eeb453818028d14a948c59b7.webp?t=1762331918 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/93d59f3db5f29964d827727d60549a31.avif?t=1762331918\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the station's secrets by solving puzzles that block your path forward. What seems like a simple obstacle might be hiding something more sinister behind it. Solve your way to safety, but don\u2019t forget: danger could be right behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Please note</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erebus-9 is  currently in development. The demo introduces you to the world of Erebus-9, featuring selected segments from the game\u2019s second level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the demo does not represent the final scope or content of the full game. All content shown is a work in progress and subject to change in the final release. The team at Centaurus Software is committed to refining Erebus-9 based on player feedback and testing. If you would like to be involved in the development of Erebus-9, please join our discord server:\u00a0<u></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full Chapter 1 release is currently targeted for Q1 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deeply appreciate your support, patience, and feedback as we continue shaping Erebus-9 into the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for playing and we hope you enjoy your time aboard the Erebus-9.</strong></p>","developers":["Centaurus Software "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/5cfb06e2ebd5f77df2dad9a0be326ff7b712e238/header.jpg?t=1762331918","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00